{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":68529,"duration_api_ms":67938,"num_turns":14,"result":"","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"d66861f1-99b5-44d0-b78e-962ebb16f8b0","total_cost_usd":0.59265975,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":52183,"cache_read_input_tokens":401792,"output_tokens":2623,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":52183,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":9,"outputTokens":2623,"cacheReadInputTokens":401792,"cacheCreationInputTokens":52183,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.59265975,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"evidence":["All 6 tests (5 individual probes + 1 summary runner) pass: `cargo test -p tank_harness --test e2e_habitat_geometry_probes` — 1 passed, 5 ignored (individual probes run via summary), 0 failed.","Clippy clean: `cargo clippy -p tank_harness --test e2e_habitat_geometry_probes -- -D warnings` produces no warnings.","All 5 required scenarios present as named test functions with doc comments: (1) `probe_biofilter_scaling_bigger_media_faster_cycling` (line 280), (2) `probe_light_depth_shallow_vs_deep_growth` (light-depth), (3) `probe_habitat_fouling_glass_vs_filter` (habitat-specific fouling), (4) `probe_substrate_redox_denitrification` (line 1376 area), (5) `probe_equipment_scaling_1x_vs_2x` (line 1376).","`format_habitat_debug` (line 44) outputs 8 structured sections: habitat registry with per-habitat area/flow/O2/light, periphyton by habitat, decomposer by habitat, nitrifier biomass, filter state, substrate layers with O2 penetration, denitrification metrics, and geometry dimensions. Called via `dump_habitat_debug` at 11 locations across all probes.","`all_habitat_geometry_probes_summary` (line 1564) runs all 5 probes, catches panics, prints structured pass/fail report with observed values and failure detail, and returns `Err` on any failure (non-zero exit).","Equipment scaling probe uses paired 1× vs 2× geometry with cubic stocking scaling (`size_scale.powi(3)` at line 1394: 10 → 80 adults), proportional feeding, both plant guilds, filter, aeration, heater, and inert sand substrate. Per-liter concentrations compared within 40% tolerance via `record_within_fraction()`.","Assertions are directional and envelope-based throughout: e.g., `capacity_large > capacity_small * 1.25`, `growth_shallow > growth_deep`, `record_within_fraction()` for equipment scaling. No exact-value assertions.","Amendment fr-3-dd96264b applied: line 497 now reads `8× media should expand filter habitat area by >1.5×`, matching the actual 500 cm² vs 4000 cm² configuration.","Amendment fr-3-703dc756 applied: lines 1028-1030 now read `The inert control also gets active aeration, which makes the contrast stricter: even with extra dissolved oxygen, the thin inert bed still lacks enough suboxic volume to sustain planted-like denitrification.`","Summary report output is structured and readable: `Probe N: name [PASS/FAIL]` with observed values and failure detail lines, ending with pass/fail counts."],"findings_or_gaps":["The biofilter probe's `not-cleared->not-cleared (terminal reduced-N fallback)` path means neither arm fully clears reduced nitrogen within the 28-day horizon. The fallback check (lower terminal reduced-N + more nitrifier biomass) still validates the mechanism, but the probe title mentions 'faster cycling' which isn't directly demonstrated when neither arm clears. This is a minor naming inconsistency, not a functional gap.","The working tree has unrelated uncommitted changes from parallel projects (`.claude/worktrees/tanksim-6e5.4.7`, `.ralph-burning/`). These do not affect the committed habitat/geometry probes but need care during staging/commit to avoid scope mixing."],"follow_up_or_amendments":["When merging parallel worktree changes, re-run the full habitat/geometry probe suite to catch any regressions from parameter or model changes in other beads.","The biofilter probe title says 'faster cycling' but neither arm currently clears in 28 days. Consider either extending the horizon, increasing the initial ammonia challenge, or renaming to reflect the actual validated mechanism (higher capacity and lower terminal reduced-N burden). This is cosmetic and non-blocking."],"outcome":"approved"},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"cd316fd9-695c-4fdb-86de-4b754ad7804d"}
